# `space.watch`

Live watch — the space registry (list + active).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.space.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `registry` | `map` |
| `space` | `string` |

## Returns

`WatchEvent` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `patches` | `map` |
| `err` | `map` |
| `hb` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call space.watch --json '{ "registry": {}, "space": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "patches": {
    "patches": [
      {
        "op": "PATCH_OP_SET",
        "value": "eyJzcGFjZXMiOltdfQ=="
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
